# Ollama model for the drafting step (queries/draft_needs.py).
# A 16,384-token context so that a chunk plus the prompt plus the answer fit, temperature 0. qwen3:14b is Q4_K_M, about 9 GB, so Ollama keeps part of it on the processor.
# Create it once with:  ollama create qwen3-14b-16k -f Modelfile-qwen3-14b-16k
FROM qwen3:14b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0
